        "original_id": "8bd5bf59-ae3d-5955-bced-418c3a500148",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Bedhead, Hinder, Overseas\n- People: Austin Winkler, Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, Cody Hanson, David Bazan, Will Johnson, Bubba Kadane, Matt Kadane\n- Places: Texas, Oklahoma\n- Albums and songs: All American Nightmare, What Ya Gonna Do\n\nFacts:\n- Bedhead was an American indie rock band based in Texas that was active from 1991 to 1998.\n- Hinder was formed in Oklahoma in 2001 by Austin Winkler, Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, and Cody Hanson.\n- Overseas is an American indie rock band that includes David Bazan, Will Johnson, Bubba Kadane, and Matt Kadane.\n- David Bazan was also associated with Pedro The Lion and Headphones.\n- Will Johnson was also associated with Centro-matic and South San Gabriel.\n- Bubba Kadane and Matt Kadane were also associated with Bedhead and The New Year.\n- \"What Ya Gonna Do\" is a single from Hinder's third album All American Nightmare.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
